#N canvas 50 50 1080 920 12;
#X text 20 10 tape-warmth — Tape emulation with saturation \, bass emphasis \, and subtle pitch flutter. This module is the core of the station sound. Defaults are subtle: you should feel the difference when you bypass it \, not hear the effect while it is active.;
